{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player takes the role of the Guard, while 1\u20137 others play as mischievous Monkeys. The jungle is filled with <strong>NPC monkeys</strong>, and player Monkeys must <strong>hide among them and act naturally</strong> to avoid suspicion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round runs on a timer. The Monkeys must feed on bananas, while the Guard tries to expose them, put them into sleep, before time runs out. Putting an NPC monkey to sleep makes the clock tick faster. If the Monkeys finish all the bananas or survive until the timer ends, the Monkeys win. If the Guard uncovers them all in time, the Guard wins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-----\u00a0 \u00a0Monkey\u00a0 \u00a0-----</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blend In</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The islands are packed with harmless NPC monkeys, and your survival depends on blending seamlessly with them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/efa5f2549a27ebe583a17ba309cfc7f4.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/efa5f2549a27ebe583a17ba309cfc7f4.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/efa5f2549a27ebe583a17ba309cfc7f4.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scratch Marks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only real player Monkeys have the speed to run, but sprinting comes at a cost. Your rapid steps leave fresh scratch marks on the ground, creating a trail the Guard can easily follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/dd4e488f6bef7f71a40686c9666c6c82.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/dd4e488f6bef7f71a40686c9666c6c82.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/dd4e488f6bef7f71a40686c9666c6c82.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Banana Crates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eating bananas keeps you alive, but every bite sends a signal that makes the Guard more aware of your presence. Choose the right time and place to snack, or you might find yourself cornered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/17efa86af405cf70948bf08f01b1f638.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/17efa86af405cf70948bf08f01b1f638.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/17efa86af405cf70948bf08f01b1f638.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fart Stun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all else fails, let one rip! A sudden, blinding fart will stun the Guard and buy you precious seconds to escape. It\u2019s silly, but it just might save your tail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/fcdd5c12aaeda8b430e6ba7493ff2c50.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/fcdd5c12aaeda8b430e6ba7493ff2c50.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/fcdd5c12aaeda8b430e6ba7493ff2c50.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Branches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branches are silent traitors waiting to give you away. Step on them and the sharp sound will instantly alert the Guard to your location. Move carefully and plan your route if you want to stay hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/3e891972abdf7f0e4a74ddd3bc29ac36.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/3e891972abdf7f0e4a74ddd3bc29ac36.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/3e891972abdf7f0e4a74ddd3bc29ac36.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Banana Radar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be cleverly sabotaged by Monkeys. Once broken, it emits a loud, irritating noise and speeds up the round\u2019s timer, creating chaos. The Guard can repair it, so keep the pressure on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/7c886190bb6286f4f1bed65a20a2e82c.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/7c886190bb6286f4f1bed65a20a2e82c.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/7c886190bb6286f4f1bed65a20a2e82c.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immortality Totem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you stand inside the glowing aura of this ancient totem, the Guard\u2019s weapons are useless against you. Carrying it, however, neutralizes its power until you place it down. Use it as a safe zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/cc0b814c644f808ff2864618d171270c.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/cc0b814c644f808ff2864618d171270c.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/cc0b814c644f808ff2864618d171270c.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magic Heal Banana</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a teammate has been put to sleep, a quick bite from the Magic Heal Banana will bring them back into the game. It can turn the tide of a round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/ee7ef0cdc5ec81bdac21a414952c1a03.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/ee7ef0cdc5ec81bdac21a414952c1a03.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/ee7ef0cdc5ec81bdac21a414952c1a03.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-----\u00a0 \u00a0Guard\u00a0 \u00a0-----</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flashlight of Truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shine this powerful beam on any Monkey that looks suspicious. If the target is a player in disguise, their eyes will flare a menacing red, instantly exposing their true identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/2483efbfc06357130e313ccee852e355.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/2483efbfc06357130e313ccee852e355.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/2483efbfc06357130e313ccee852e355.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dream Glow Gun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This strange dream-powered blaster puts Monkeys into a deep sleep. Aim carefully, though\u2014hitting the wrong NPC shortens the timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/e7038403ac8fd981255febbbd9817e47.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/e7038403ac8fd981255febbbd9817e47.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/e7038403ac8fd981255febbbd9817e47.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>----- Have Fun !!! :) -----</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/cd7bffc0feb6c36ee697c7665cb51906.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/cd7bffc0feb6c36ee697c7665cb51906.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/cd7bffc0feb6c36ee697c7665cb51906.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507180?t=1768036781","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/c5129e2de1523605c73950b05c35d925bfa1aa48/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768036781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/89e3c352df0cb00989458b0fbc0c0d8eab659d54/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768036781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/89e3c352df0cb00989458b0fbc0c0d8eab659d54/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768036781","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player takes the role of the Guard, while 1\u20137 others play as mischievous Monkeys. The jungle is filled with <strong>NPC monkeys</strong>, and player Monkeys must <strong>hide among them and act naturally</strong> to avoid suspicion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round runs on a timer. The Monkeys must feed on bananas, while the Guard tries to expose them, put them into sleep, before time runs out. Putting an NPC monkey to sleep makes the clock tick faster. If the Monkeys finish all the bananas or survive until the timer ends, the Monkeys win. If the Guard uncovers them all in time, the Guard wins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-----\u00a0 \u00a0Monkey\u00a0 \u00a0-----</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blend In</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The islands are packed with harmless NPC monkeys, and your survival depends on blending seamlessly with them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/efa5f2549a27ebe583a17ba309cfc7f4.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/efa5f2549a27ebe583a17ba309cfc7f4.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/efa5f2549a27ebe583a17ba309cfc7f4.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scratch Marks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only real player Monkeys have the speed to run, but sprinting comes at a cost. Your rapid steps leave fresh scratch marks on the ground, creating a trail the Guard can easily follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/dd4e488f6bef7f71a40686c9666c6c82.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/dd4e488f6bef7f71a40686c9666c6c82.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/dd4e488f6bef7f71a40686c9666c6c82.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Banana Crates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eating bananas keeps you alive, but every bite sends a signal that makes the Guard more aware of your presence. Choose the right time and place to snack, or you might find yourself cornered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/17efa86af405cf70948bf08f01b1f638.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/17efa86af405cf70948bf08f01b1f638.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/17efa86af405cf70948bf08f01b1f638.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fart Stun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all else fails, let one rip! A sudden, blinding fart will stun the Guard and buy you precious seconds to escape. It\u2019s silly, but it just might save your tail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/fcdd5c12aaeda8b430e6ba7493ff2c50.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/fcdd5c12aaeda8b430e6ba7493ff2c50.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/fcdd5c12aaeda8b430e6ba7493ff2c50.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Branches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branches are silent traitors waiting to give you away. Step on them and the sharp sound will instantly alert the Guard to your location. Move carefully and plan your route if you want to stay hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/3e891972abdf7f0e4a74ddd3bc29ac36.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/3e891972abdf7f0e4a74ddd3bc29ac36.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/3e891972abdf7f0e4a74ddd3bc29ac36.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Banana Radar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be cleverly sabotaged by Monkeys. Once broken, it emits a loud, irritating noise and speeds up the round\u2019s timer, creating chaos. The Guard can repair it, so keep the pressure on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/7c886190bb6286f4f1bed65a20a2e82c.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/7c886190bb6286f4f1bed65a20a2e82c.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/7c886190bb6286f4f1bed65a20a2e82c.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immortality Totem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you stand inside the glowing aura of this ancient totem, the Guard\u2019s weapons are useless against you. Carrying it, however, neutralizes its power until you place it down. Use it as a safe zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/cc0b814c644f808ff2864618d171270c.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/cc0b814c644f808ff2864618d171270c.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/cc0b814c644f808ff2864618d171270c.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magic Heal Banana</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a teammate has been put to sleep, a quick bite from the Magic Heal Banana will bring them back into the game. It can turn the tide of a round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/ee7ef0cdc5ec81bdac21a414952c1a03.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/ee7ef0cdc5ec81bdac21a414952c1a03.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/ee7ef0cdc5ec81bdac21a414952c1a03.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-----\u00a0 \u00a0Guard\u00a0 \u00a0-----</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flashlight of Truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shine this powerful beam on any Monkey that looks suspicious. If the target is a player in disguise, their eyes will flare a menacing red, instantly exposing their true identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/2483efbfc06357130e313ccee852e355.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/2483efbfc06357130e313ccee852e355.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/2483efbfc06357130e313ccee852e355.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dream Glow Gun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This strange dream-powered blaster puts Monkeys into a deep sleep. Aim carefully, though\u2014hitting the wrong NPC shortens the timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/e7038403ac8fd981255febbbd9817e47.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/e7038403ac8fd981255febbbd9817e47.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/e7038403ac8fd981255febbbd9817e47.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>----- Have Fun !!! :) -----</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/cd7bffc0feb6c36ee697c7665cb51906.poster.avif?t=1768036781\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/cd7bffc0feb6c36ee697c7665cb51906.webm?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/extras/cd7bffc0feb6c36ee697c7665cb51906.mp4?t=1768036781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Michal Deak"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507180/d3d2680392f34074ad54dbd28e6a1251d7c6f397/header.jpg?t=1768036781","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3507180/1237074455/7fda3c8cbddce2a38881f53a42b2fa417d5f6840/1767199635/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767203613","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3507180/1237074455/7fda3c8cbddce2a38881f53a42b2fa417d5f6840/1767199635/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767203613","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3507180/1237074455/7fda3c8cbddce2a38881f53a42b2fa417d5f6840/1767199635/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767203613","id":257257470,"name":"Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257257470/0e07eda44b5d7ea9e51c70defa1f0273ad89d07a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767203613"}],"name":"Banana Keeper","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul